Package: com.mikey820.airpodsreconnectfix
Name: AirPodsReconnectFix
Version: 2.7.8
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: iOS 6 AirPods fix (post-AirPods-Pro-3 firmware): pre-emptive service re-assert every 18s to head off the ~45s firmware disconnect, plus burst-reconnect fallback
Maintainer: mikey820 <mikey820@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: mikey820
Section: Tweaks
Icon: icon.png
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), firmware (>= 6.0)
